      <title>GOAD (Game of Active Directory) NHA #3 - Bypassing Defender and Achieving SYSTEM on SQL Host</title>
      <link>https://emc2hf.github.io/blog/2025/09/10/goad-game-of-active-directory-nha-%233-bypassing-defender-and-achieving-system-on-sql-host/</link>
